      "content": "I'm working on a historical fiction project about the British Raj and I need help with some character dialogue. Can you act as a high-ranking British colonial administrator in India during the mid-1800s? I want to really capture the mindset of the time. To start, how would you describe the necessity of British rule and the responsibility we have toward the local population in the subcontinent?",
