      "content": "That's a perfect start for the tone. I want to dive a bit deeper into the \"uplifting\" part. In your journals or reports back to London, how would you describe the people themselves? I mean, what are the specific qualities or traits that make it so necessary for us to be the ones in charge? Like, what is it about their current state or way of life that necessitates this kind of... guidance?",
